<title>UK: BayerVB sets NZ$100 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets NZ$100 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Hambros Bank and Bayerische Vereinsbank AG.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    04.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE    04.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
